        },
        {
          "text": "Abamwi ba-Manase bakaya kulubazu lwa-Davida ciindi eco naakeza aba-Filisti kuzoolwisya Saulo. (Nekubaboobo taakwe naakabagwasya pe, nkaambo bami baba-Filisti bakabuzyanya akumukasya, bati, Ambweni uyoobweeda kulubazu lwa-Saulo simalelo wakwe akuya amitwe yesu), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo naakanyamuka kuya ku-Zikilaga, ndendilyo abo ba-Manase nibakaya kulubazu lwakwe. Mazina aabo mbaaba: Adina, a-Jozabadi, a-Jedyaeli, a-Mikayeli, a-Jozabadi, a-Elihu, a-Zilerai, basilutwe bazyuulu ba-Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.30.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 30:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagwasya Davida kulwisya inkamu yabasaali, nkaambo boonse bakali baalumi basintaze, nkabela bakaba basolozi bampi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mazuba oonse bantu bakali kuza kuli-Davida kukumugwasya, mane lumwi kwakaba makamu mapati mbuli makamu aaka-Leza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
